  "label": "Dog as Animal Stereotype",
  "description": "The use of a dog (specifically a bulldog) to represent human emotions or behaviors is a longstanding cultural trope. In this context, the dog is used as a stand-in for a person expressing anger or defiance. This requires knowledge of anthropomorphism and the use of animals as symbols in visual media.",
